```sql
CREATE TABLE reminders(id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, title TEXT NOT NULL, status TEXT DEFAULT 'open');
INSERT INTO reminders(id,title) VALUES(1,'Read');
INSERT INTO reminders VALUES(2,'Walk','done');
SELECT id,title,status
FROM reminders
ORDER BY id;
```
Row 2 now stores done because the supplied value wins. Row 1 still uses open.

